{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Similariddle</i> is a challenging word-guess game where the system provides extremely abstract &quot;<strong>similarity</strong>&quot; values based on algorithms. You need to test the similarity between various words and the target word, and finally find out the target word.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game includes different modes such as <strong>Daily</strong>, <strong>Custom,</strong> and <strong>Level</strong>. For words in Custom mode that you have no idea or find interesting, you can also copy its code to share it with friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are also hidden levels waiting for you to discover in every corner of the game!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3408740?t=1772505343","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408740/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1772505343","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408740/b59f4069448ac2ae7880897021b53acfb26cc056/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1772505343","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3408740/b59f4069448ac2ae7880897021b53acfb26cc056/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1772505343","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"demos":[{"appid":3426620,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Similariddle</i> is a challenging word-guess game where the system provides extremely abstract &quot;<strong>similarity</strong>&quot; values based on algorithms. You need to test the similarity between various words and the target word, and finally find out the target word.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game includes different modes such as <strong>Daily</strong>, <strong>Custom,</strong> and <strong>Level</strong>. For words in Custom mode that you have no idea or find int